|  Amazingly, however, the therapist saw nothing in the mother’s report
|  but evidence that she was unhealthily enmeshed with her child. She
|  amplified this concern in testimony before the court:Enmeshment does [happen] when there are unclear boundaries,
|  permeable boundaries between people and, um, there are needs
|  that get met for one person by the other, um, There’s a, there’s an
|  intense need for closeness. Um, that, that kind of gets to the point
